    "Actual10 source documents are Blender collection/controller contracts; version2 execution requires explicit host Blender executable and --version identity.",
    "Default three-native path does not require a Blender executable, but these10 saved source/plan contracts are not native-family project contracts. Matching a family name does not prove model/control/material/camera equivalence.",
    "Current rigid glTF import is a bounded static-mesh/PBR route; it does not import Blender drivers, shader graphs or animation. Static mesh import alone does not establish all30 control tracks.",
    "Full Blender-free production, if required under the original plan, must preserve or explicitly validate actual meshes, named parts/anchors, controls, camera/edit behavior, selected design, all10 clocks/whole narration and full delivery/review lifecycle.",
    "A cached-picture-only substitute does not prove arbitrary part/control/camera edits; no such substitute is admitted.",
    "No smaller engineering cohort, substituted original subjects or synthetic speech can satisfy the actual-first-ten requirement."
  ],
